    "detailed_description": "\u201cAuspicious Light\u201d is a large-scale military vehicle shooting game. The game contains several maps and vehicles for players to choose from. Players can also collect resources on the battlefield, recast their tanks, upgrade chips, and compete with 30 tanks to rebuild their new homes.<br><br>[Game Modes]<br>You can choose to defend the base, or be a brave man who charges into battle, utilizing tactical weapons, reasonable combinations, and collecting resources. You can fight alone or invite your friends to fight together as a team. The game contains a variety of game modes. For example\uff0cConfrontation, Mining, Capturing the Flag, Capturing the Train and Occupy the Base. We look forward to your arrival.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2656560/extras/f08526f7716d4f7f299b30baa4cde48e.poster.avif?t=1715215676\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2656560/extras/f08526f7716d4f7f299b30baa4cde48e.webm?t=1715215676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2656560/extras/f08526f7716d4f7f299b30baa4cde48e.mp4?t=1715215676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>[Characteristic Chariots]<br>The game has several characteristic chariots, you can drive agile and lightweight armored vehicle to scout the enemy, or you can drive artillery vehicle with excellent firepower to shell the enemy from a distance, or you can use the explosive rocket vehicle to provide continuous firepower output. There is always a chariot for you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2656560/extras/b8ce696164141c0fd3f63b87f0704836.poster.avif?t=1715215676\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2656560/extras/b8ce696164141c0fd3f63b87f0704836.webm?t=1715215676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2656560/extras/b8ce696164141c0fd3f63b87f0704836.mp4?t=1715215676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>[Functional Systems]<br>Players can enter the battlefield to collect resources, manufacture equipment, recast tanks, upgrade commanders and activate chips. Skill chips can be freely matched and assembled to enhance the performance of tanks. These make players invincible on the battlefield.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2656560/extras/3a49b44600648ea4a7812404a8a3a56d.poster.avif?t=1715215676\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2656560/extras/3a49b44600648ea4a7812404a8a3a56d.webm?t=1715215676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2656560/extras/3a49b44600648ea4a7812404a8a3a56d.mp4?t=1715215676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>[Ultra-Realistic Maps]<br>The battlefield experience is ultra-realistic and includes beautiful scenery from all over the world. There are deserts, plains, hills, and the Gobi. You can take advantage of the geography and experience intense and exciting battle scenes.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2656560/extras/09e9c6332592e349db8aef75e36cae4a.poster.avif?t=1715215676\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2656560/extras/09e9c6332592e349db8aef75e36cae4a.webm?t=1715215676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2656560/extras/09e9c6332592e349db8aef75e36cae4a.mp4?t=1715215676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>[Huge Worldview]<br>The war zone is gradually expanding to the entire Eastern Theater. The situation is becoming more serious and intense. Will you be able to stand out from the crowd? Start as a new recruit and grow into an excellent general.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2656560/extras/bd265ea4585a5f861f1940aa6c9a9acf.poster.avif?t=1715215676\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2656560/extras/bd265ea4585a5f861f1940aa6c9a9acf.webm?t=1715215676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2656560/extras/bd265ea4585a5f861f1940aa6c9a9acf.mp4?t=1715215676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
